        PMT_FRN_1COT,--PMT전면1Coat
        PMT_FRN_2COT,--PMT전면2Coat
        PMT_FRN_3COT,--PMT전면3Coat
        PMT_FRN_4COT,--PMT전면4Coat
        PMT_BAK_1COT,--PMT후면1Coat
        PMT_BAK_2COT,--PMT후면2Coat
        PMT_BAK_3COT,--PMT후면3Coat
        PMT_BAK_4COT,--PMT후면4Coat
        THR_CD_FRN_1COT,--신나코드전면1Coat
        THR_CD_FRN_2COT,--신나코드전면2Coat
        THR_CD_FRN_3COT,--신나코드전면3Coat
        THR_CD_FRN_4COT,--신나코드전면4Coat
